# Session continuity

At the start of every task, read `docs/HANDOFF.md` and `docs/AGENT_PROMPT.md` before changing code.

Work in small, complete steps. After each finished change:

1. Update `docs/HANDOFF.md` (status, files touched, what the next agent should do).
2. Commit with a short message that explains why.
3. Push to `origin/main`.

Never leave the next session guessing. If you stop mid-task, write the blocker and the exact next command or file in `docs/HANDOFF.md`.
